e":"河北临漳西南","start_index":81,"tongjian_id":"8d4b74f0-db0e-11ef-909a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"戰國","place_name_jianti_auto":"战国","start_index":84,"tongjian_id":"8d4b74f1-db0e-11ef-afce-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"韓","place_name_jianti_auto":"韩","start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"8d4b74f2-db0e-11ef-b878-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","start_index":92,"tongjian_id":"8d4b74f3-db0e-11ef-9b0e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"平阳","start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"8d4b74f4-db0e-11ef-8172-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河東","place_name_jianti_auto":"河东","start_index":107,"tongjian_id":"8d4b74f5-db0e-11ef-8767-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"平阳","start_index":110,"tongjian_id":"8d4b74f6-db0e-11ef-82a2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"齮，丘奇翻，又去倚翻。敗，補邁翻。將，卽亮翻。扈，夏有扈氏之後，音戶。輒，陟涉翻。後漢志，魏郡鄴縣有平陽城。括地志：平陽故城，在相州臨漳縣西二十五里。史記正義曰：平陽，戰國時屬韓，後屬趙。若據正義所云，則以此平陽爲河東之平陽，非也。當以後漢志、括地志爲正。","note_content_jianti_auto":"𬺈，丘奇翻，又去倚翻。败，补迈翻。将，即亮翻。扈，夏有扈氏之后，音户。辄，陟涉翻。后汉志，魏郡邺县有平阳城。括地志：平阳故城，在相州临漳县西二十五里。史记正义曰：平阳，战国时属韩，后属赵。若据正义所云，则以此平阳为河东之平阳，非也。当以后汉志、括地志为正。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8d4b74e6-db0e-11ef-b284-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"8d4b74fe-db0e-11ef-bddd-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"肥子","people_name_jianti_auto":"肥子","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"8d4b74ff-db0e-11ef-88a5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"宜安","place_name_jianti_auto":"宜安","place_note":"河北藁城西南","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8d4b7500-db0e-11ef-bed6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"常山","place_name_jianti_auto":"常山","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8d4b7501-db0e-11ef-b7e2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"藁城縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"藁城县","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8d4b7502-db0e-11ef-a681-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"肥下","place_name_jianti_auto":"肥下","place_note":"河北藁城","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8d4b7503-db0e-11ef-a94a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"眞定國","place_name_jianti_auto":"真定国","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"8d4b7504-db0e-11ef-8364-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"肥纍縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"肥累县","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8d4b7505-db0e-11ef-8579-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"春秋","place_name_jianti_auto":"春秋","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"8d4b7506-db0e-11ef-af0a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"肥纍","place_name_jianti_auto":"肥累","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"8d4b7507-db0e-11ef-b267-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"藁城縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"藁城县","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"8d4b7508-db0e-11ef-be99-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"復，扶又翻。括地志：宜安故城，在常山藁城縣西南二十五里。肥下，卽班志眞定國之肥纍縣，春秋肥子之國。括地志：肥纍故城，在藁城縣西七里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"复，扶又翻。括地志：宜安故城，在常山藁城县西南二十五里。肥下，即班志真定国之肥累县，春秋肥子之国。括地志：肥累故城，在藁城县西七里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8d4b74fd-db0e-11ef-9f5c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"大崩曰敗績。","note_content_jianti_auto":"大崩曰败绩。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"8d4b750c-db0e-11ef-8572-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"大將軍","official_note":"大將軍是古代中國的高級軍事指揮官，通常負責統領軍隊作戰。在《資治通鑑》此段中，趙王任命李牧爲大將軍，以應對秦國的進攻，顯示其在趙國軍事體系中的關鍵地位。","official_rank":"高級將領","source_snippet":"趙王以李牧爲大將軍","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"f4899156-ad56-4ad5-8145-4eeaa7fdd692"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"封爵","official_name":"武安君","official_note":"武安君是戰國時期趙國的一種封爵，通常授予有重大戰功的將領。在此段中，趙國封李牧爲武安君，以表彰其在擊敗秦軍中的功績，這反映了古代封爵制度對軍事成就的獎勵。","official_rank":"君侯","source_snippet":"趙封李牧爲武安君","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"11bd1c41-6cce-4583-8f9c-66a248dfa221"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-279,"link_death_year":-229,"link_td_description":"战国末年秦国将军。","link_td_id":"Q10007896","link_td_number_id":316660,"people_name":"桓齮","people_name_jianti_auto":"桓𬺈","people_xingming":"桓齮","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8d4b750e-db0e-11ef-9162-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-233,"link_td_description":"扈辄，赵国大将，受业于儒学，早年随廉颇、庞煖征战，素为赵国佞臣郭开所重用，接管魏国所割让的邺郡三城。赵王迁二年（前234年），秦国大将桓齮攻邺，扈辄出兵拒之，双方大战于东崮山，扈辄兵败。桓齮乘胜追逐，遂拔邺，连破九城，扈辄退保宜安，向赵国告急。不久桓齮攻克赵国的平阳、武城，扈辄被秦军杀死。","link_td_id":"Q10008557","link_td_number_id":327784,"people_name":"扈輒","people_name_jianti_auto":"扈辄","people_xingming":"扈辄","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8d4b750f-db0e-11ef-b9ec-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-233,"link_td_description":"扈辄，赵国大将，受业于儒学，早年随廉颇、庞煖征战，素为赵国佞臣郭开所重用，接管魏国所割让的邺郡三城。赵王迁二年（前234年），秦国大将桓齮攻邺，扈辄出兵拒之，双方大战于东崮山，扈辄兵败。桓齮乘胜追逐，遂拔邺，连破九城，扈辄退保宜安，向赵国告急。不久桓齮攻克赵国的平阳、武城，扈辄被秦军杀死。","link_td_id":"Q10008557","link_td_number_id":327784,"people_name":"扈輒","people_name_jianti_auto":"扈辄","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8d4b7513-db0e-11ef-af55-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-245,"link_death_year":-222,"link_td_description":"赵幽缪王，又称赵王迁，是中国战国时期赵国君主，本名赵迁，赵悼襄王之子。为宋朝皇族的始祖。","link_td_id":"Q10000658","link_td_number_id":327776,"people_name":"趙王","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵王","people_xingming":"赵迁","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"8d4b7514-db0e-11ef-8b57-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[赵迁]"},{"link_death_year":-229,"link_td_description":"李牧，名繓，字牧，以字行，战国后期军事家，赵国名将，与白起、王翦、廉颇并称战国四名将。李牧驻守代郡、雁门郡期间，率军大破匈奴。在肥之战、番吾之战两次击败秦国，受封武安君，但最终被赵幽缪王杀害。","link_td_id":"Q10008275","link_td_number_id":184014,"people_name":"李牧","people_name_jianti_auto":"李牧","people_xingming":"李牧","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"8d4b7515-db0e-11ef-9349-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-279,"link_death_year":-229,"link_td_description":"战国末年秦国将军。","link_td_id":"Q10007896","link_td_number_id":316660,"peopl